{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act5d0_level_act5d0_09_beg",
  "groupId": "act5d0",
  "stageId": "act5d0_09",
  "title": "0:01A.M.",
  "storyCode": "CB-9",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/activities/act5d0/level_act5d0_09_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "a0a226f400541f8d90d82e79d9f248be91d35dfcce7e1b56e42be8af22ffedcf",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lmstreet_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...I'm tired of this."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waai Fu",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Nng——!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You're strong. And you've shown me some really cool kung fu."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But I can't keep playin' with you like this."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Real sorry about this, but you, your buddy, and that traitor, you all gotta die here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Boys, weapons ready."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ready!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waai Fu",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So you're going to win with sheer numbers...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Capone",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It ain't so simple, Gambino."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Capone",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Listen up, once the so-called 'boss' opens fire, that's the official announcement of the end of your affiliation with the Gambino Family. Don't go easy on 'em."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Got it!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Waai Fu, this side too..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waai Fu",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We're getting boxed in."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hah. We got the Family all split up, and the prey becomes the predator. We got a nice chaotic battle here each fallin' into each other's traps."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's just like that time back in Siracusa... But this time, it's a gamble we got no choice but to win."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Capone",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Too bad you've always been a shit gambler."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "All right. That's enough. Settle down."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Capone",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You finally crawled out of your filthy hole?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Mr. Gambino, I am truly sorry, but I've given you and your Family so many chances."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We got no trust between us at all. You really think I'd hand the Family over to some non-Sicilian freak?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Sicilian. While I have not once in my life set foot in a Siracusan city, I do know that you are unworthy of describing yourself as such."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...What are you gonna do?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The time for questions has passed, young man. And you have broken the rules far too many times."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Once was your transgression, another was yours. But it matters not. You have both overstepped your bounds."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Capone",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You goin' back on your deal?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I made no deal."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hmph. You really think you can take us?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You sit on a throne in a stinking sewer, telling desperate people who got no choice but to throw down their lives what to do. That's you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It behooves you, as head of your household, to broaden your horizons."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Compared to everything we have been through, your little Siracusan fiasco was a stubbed toe."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Shut up!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Have you ever seen a true onslaught? What it means to truly have barbarians at your gates?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "When moving cities crash against one another, smoke chokes the skies, and the dying infected rot away by cesspools, crying in hopeless agony?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You know nothing. And yet you think to fight a city."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Capone",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(He's immensely powerful... him and that woman with him...)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Capone",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Shit, we have to at least stop provoking the Rat King... now is not the time...)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You think you stand for all of Lungmen?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Lungmen certainly cannot stand for me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Enough talk! Haah——!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waai Fu",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No one will permit you to strike this old man."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Get back, Waai Fu!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Out of my way!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Thank you. You are Ah Fil. I've heard your story."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You're the one Uncle always talks about..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Heh, my old friend."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I thank you for helping Lungmen put a stop to them. And I thank you for your pursuit of justice."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Now, please leave."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waai Fu",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I promised many times to many people that I would not let the children get mixed up in such matters."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...Waai Fu."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waai Fu",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The children are gone. And with them your hope of victory."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Put down your weapons, kneel before me, and your 'Family' will have at least some chance to survive."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Do you really think your threats mean anything?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...You are on our land. It means to us what Siracusa means to you. You must know this much."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You still have some chips on the table, young man. Wouldn't you like to save them?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Qui- quicksand?! Run!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Aaaaaagh! My hand! D- don't touch the sand!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You cocky——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hmph."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Calm yourself, young man. I don't need my hands to stop your sword."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Look around you at your companions. This city has bled so much already. I really don't want to see 'Family' killing one another on the program."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "This is your last chance."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I ain't gonna turn coward again. Leaving Siracusa was the last step backwards for my Family."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'd rather die here like a true Sicilian than ever let the enemy see me run off with my tail between my legs."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Perhaps in your mind, this is the way for a warrior to behave. But for a leader, going too far is as bad as not going far enough."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You should reflect, and introspect. Unfortunately, it is too late."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Aaaagh!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Capone",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...This is the end, Gambino. You should never have bet the whole Family on this."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Capone, you, you son of a——!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Capone",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Calm down. We don't want you to go out too hard."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Gah!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Capone",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Funny. You don't look surprised at all. Were you waiting for me to do this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What are you thinking, backstabbing boss-killer?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Capone",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'll offer up the whole Family. We're gonna live here, in Lungmen. And we're not gonna fall on our swords for no good reason."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's too bad... if you were truly willing to work together, that woman never would have exiled you from Siracusa."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Capone",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You know a lot about us... But I'm not gonna ask. It's Lungmen."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Indeed. It's Lungmen."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You mean I should be easier on you, since you're willing to personally discipline the disobedient?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Capone",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "My Family will take orders from you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "'Your Family.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You are simply describing the situation as it is. You made so many miscalculations you have no other choice."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Capone",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Right. It's been a hell of a night. I've had a lotta setbacks. But that's business."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Mmm... Business."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You're absolutely right. This is an excellent deal. Fair and equitable."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Capone",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Then——!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But, Mr. Capone, it's Lungmen."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's not me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Capone",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I have no need of your loyalty. Never did."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Capone",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Capone",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You... from the very beginning, you were..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's what it is. We gotta survive."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "When you tried to worm your way into Lungmen, your mutual suspicion ground turned you up into a sheet of sand. A stone is hard to break. But sand? I can easily scoop up a handful."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I have no love of trickery. It's really no fun at all. What matters is what I said a few minutes ago: I truly do not wish to see family massacre family..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And yet you did harm to your own brother, right in front of me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Now for this, I would not say you've crossed the ultimate line. So I will not kill you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's just that, since you disobeyed me, I'm afraid I have no need of such a crafty and conniving friend."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Capone",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You...! You had these moles in the Family from the very beginning! And you waited until we got at each other's throats, and then you...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Capone",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Gah!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You're wasting your life on idle words, young man."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Heh... while you toyed around with the power over them, your underlings were mulling it all over for you. Truly remarkable."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Their loyalty has bought them a chance to survive in Lungmen. And a life for each of you as well."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Now then, you have seen for yourselves the choices made by these two leaders, and now the time has come for you to fulfill your commitments."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Capone",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...Heh."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Capone",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Rat King. No, Lin. Lin Gray, you're more Sicilian than either of us."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Capone",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You tore my honor to shreds, and then you let me live? Are you trying to humiliate me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Astonishing. To save your life, you don't hesitate to draw a sword on your own brother, your own leader, and yet when I offer to let you live, you are determined to die?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I thought only the one out cold over there would gnash his teeth at me so."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Capone",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That's because I too am 'Sicilian.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Capone",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Or I guess I should ask if you really thought you could wipe out one of Siracusa's 'Families' and get away with it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Idle threats. You must know that nobody will go to war over an erased Family. Take a step back and see that even though some hopeless, scattered warriors may ignorantly think to act..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...I say let them come. Let them be torn to shreds by the true rage of this city."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Capone",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Grr!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You alone have no power to stand against us."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Now. Go."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Capone",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Capone",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...I guess my life just has to go on for now, but one day you'll regret that you didn't kill me, a true Sicilian, today."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Capone",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No question."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...If I were to send a man to kill him now, what would you do?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You wouldn't do that."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But what he said is true. I have no reason to be so lenient with a Siracusan mafioso."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We had a deal. When we came face to face, we'd defect, and you'd let the others go."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Unless, of course, the remaining mobsters force a fight to the death."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Heh heh. Don't worry. He didn't mean that. He's simply a coward who wants to live. But his anger is not feigned."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "An unrighteous man has nothing for which to live."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Remarkable. His negligible dignity saved his life, in the end."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Go. It is time to bring this evening to its conclusion."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
